      "id": 1357552,
      "name": "[3] Porcelume Protective Equipment",
      "desc": "<color=#FFAF2C>Lightning</color> deals <color=#FFAF2C>reduced DMG</color> to Agents and negates interrupt effects. After triggering <color=#FFAF2C>Lightning Counter</color>, gains a <color=#FFAF2C>shield</color> that lasts 15s and increases Anti-Interrupt Level, can be triggered once every 15s.\n<color=#FFAF2C>Meteor</color> deals <color=#FFAF2C>reduced DMG</color> to Agents and negates interrupt effects. After triggering <color=#FFAF2C>Blaze</color>, gains a <color=#FFAF2C>shield</color> that lasts 15s and increases Anti-Interrupt Level, can be triggered once every 15s.\n<color=#FFAF2C>Miasma accumulation speed</color> is greatly reduced. When Miasma Quelling is triggered, <color=#FFAF2C>continuously restore HP</color>.",
